      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F00200071007500650020007600750065006C00760061007300200070006F0072002000610071007500ED002000610020007500730061007200200065006C002000730069006D0075006C00610064006F0072000A006400650020006E007500650076006F002E0000",
